OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over scam calls from old
OL,4,Apolice number
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers are warning people to be on
OL,7,Ftheir guard after receiving reports of
OL,8,Ffraudsters using a disused police
OL,9,Fstation telephone number.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said it had
OL,12,Freceived numerous reports from people
OL,13,Fthat they were being contacted by
OL,14,Fsomeone using an old Wellingborough
OL,15,FPolice Station number.
OL,17,FThe number 01933 440333 was in use
OL,18,Funtil October 2011, when the force
OL,19,Fswitched to the 101 non-emergency
OL,20,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
