OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over scam calls from old
OL,4,Apolice number
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said the force
OL,7,Fwould never ring people to ask them to
OL,8,Ftransfer money, share personal
OL,9,Ffinancial details or hand over remote
OL,10,Fcontrol of their computers.
